Confirm your email address
==========================

Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || @user.email %>,

Thanks for signing up. Please confirm your email address by submitting the token below.

Token: <%= @raw_token %>

POST to /api/v1/auth/confirm with { "token": "<token>" }

This token expires in 24 hours. If you did not create an account, you can safely ignore this email.
